         "text": "By the power rule, \\( - 6 x^{4} \\) has derivative \\( - 24 x^{3} \\), \\( \\frac{6}{x^{3}} \\) has derivative \\( - \\frac{18}{x^{4}} \\), and the constant has derivative 0.",
